  "ruleText": "Bar 402.01 Commencement of Adjudicative Proceedings. Except for emergency proceedings initiated as provided in Plc 206.07, adjudicative proceedings shall proceed in accordance with Plc 206.06.\n\nSource. #14537, eff 4-24-26",
